What CC BY covers

  The compilation: the selection and ordering of styles, the lookalike
  character choices in the mimic / greek / runic / upside-down / small-caps
  tables, the labels and categories, and the reverse
  (de-fancify) table with its disambiguation choices.

  It does not cover facts defined by the Unicode Standard — e.g. that
  U+1D400 is MATHEMATICAL BOLD CAPITAL A. Anyone may derive such mappings
  from the Unicode Character Database independently.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Unicode

  scripts/build.py and scripts/verify.py --online read DerivedAge.txt from
  the Unicode Character Database (https://www.unicode.org/Public/16.0.0/ucd/)
  at run time to compute each style's unicode_age. No Unicode data file is
  redistributed here. Unicode is a registered trademark of Unicode, Inc.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Wingdings

  The "wingdings" style maps ASCII characters to the standard Unicode
  characters that correspond to the glyphs at the same positions in the
  Wingdings font. No font data is included. Wingdings is a trademark of
  Microsoft Corporation; this project is not affiliated with Microsoft.
